      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>he elder shantak's scales are slimy, granting it a +3 circumstance bonus to Escape. A creature mounted on a shantak takes double the normal circumstance penalty to its Reflex saves (–4 instead of –2 in most cases) while mounted.</p>",
